---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us - CalorieAce"
  description="Learn about CalorieAce, a free, easy-to-use calorie calculator built to help you understand your daily calorie, macro, and BMI needs."
>
  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-charcoal">About Us</h1>

    <div class="mt-6 space-y-6 font-body text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        CalorieAce was built with one goal: to make it fast and simple to find out exactly how many calories your body needs each day — without wading through cluttered ads, confusing jargon, or requiring you to create an account.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our calculators use the Mifflin-St Jeor equation, one of the most accurate and widely used formulas for estimating Basal Metabolic Rate (BMR), combined with your activity level to give you a realistic daily maintenance calorie number, plus a macro breakdown and BMI.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether you're looking to lose weight, gain weight, or simply maintain where you are, our dedicated calculators and guides are designed to give you a clear, practical starting point.
      </p>
      <p>
        We're not a substitute for professional medical or nutritional advice — always consult a doctor or registered dietitian for guidance specific to your health situation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>